    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University's School of Nursing and Midwifery, AKU-SONAM, has recently initiated a work-study programme under its Foundations for Health and Empowerment, F4HE project, for nurses and midwives of Kyrgyzstan with the support of AKF, Kyrgyzstan. This is a three-month training being offered in-person at AKU-SONAM, Karachi, to build nursing and midwifery care and education capacity of professionals from Central Asia.",
